       ],
       "do": "Size a CSTR for a conversion, find the conversion from the space time, and treat tanks in series.",
       "ek": [
        "V = v₀X / [k(1 − X)]; X = kτ/(1 + kτ); n equal tanks give C/C₀ = 1/(1 + kτ)ⁿ."
